%N A061523 Integer part of the blowup factor for A025587(n).
%F A061523 a(n) = floor((A295163(n)*3+1) / A025587(n)) except for a(0) = 1. - _M. F. Hasler_, Oct 21 2026
%e A061523 a(3) = 10 since A025587(3) = 15 and starting with 15 in the Collatz sequence gives a maximum value of 160 with a blowup factor of 160/15 = 10.66666...
%t A061523 With[{s = Array[Max@ NestWhileList[If[EvenQ@ #, #/2, 3 # + 1] &, #, # > 1 &]/# &, 2^18]}, Floor@ Union@ FoldList[Max, s]] (* _Michael De Vlieger_, Mar 13 2018 *)
%o A061523 (PARI) A061523(n)=if(n, A295163(n)*3+1, 1)\A025587(n) \\ _M. F. Hasler_, Oct 21 2026
%Y A061523 Cf. A025586 (maximum in the trajectory of n), A025587 (record indices), A295163 (largest odd value in the trajectory).
%K A061523 nonn,changed
%O A061523 0,2
